  "title": "Hot Crab Dip Appetizer",
  "description": "This hot crab dip recipe is easy to make with cream cheese, mayo, onion, hot sauce, and lemon for a warm, savory oven-baked dish, great with crackers.",
  "authors": [
    "William Uncle Bill Anatooskin"
